msgstr "\n"
"=============================================\n"
"|icon| Account Invoice Check Total 10.0.1.0.0\n"
"=============================================\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"**Check if the verification total is equal to the bill's total**\n"
"\n"
".. |icon| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zeroincombenze/l10n-italy/10.0/account_invoice_check_total/static/description/icon.png\n"
"\n"
"|Maturity| |Build Status| |Codecov Status| |license gpl| |Try Me|\n"
