msgid "\n"
"====================================================\n"
"|icon| Italian Localisation - Fiscal Code 10.0.1.0.3\n"
"====================================================\n"
"\n"
"\n"
".. |icon| image:: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zeroincombenze/l10n-italy/10.0/l10n_it_fiscalcode/static/description/icon.png\n"
"\n"
