msgid ".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.svg\n"
"    :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"Sale Address Management with multiple warehouse sourcing\n"
"========================================================\n"
"\n"
"Description\n"
"===========\n"
"\n"
"This module updates the way the origin address (from\n"
