#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_base_technical_user
msgid ".. image:: https://img.shields.io/badge/licence-AGPL--3-blue.svg\n"
"   :target: http://www.gnu.org/licenses/agpl-3.0-standalone.html\n"
"   :alt: License: AGPL-3\n"
"\n"
"===================\n"
"Base Technical User\n"
"===================\n"
"\n"
"This module extends the functionality of company management.\n"
"It allows you to bind a technical user on the company in order to use it in\n"
"batch processes.\n"
"\n"
