"\n"
"This module allows to define several rules to restrict product flows based on\n"
"countries or country groups (Embargoes).\n"
"\n"
"It provides rules that apply:\n"
"\n"
"* Globally (for all products)\n"
"* Per Category\n"
"* Per Product\n"
"* Per Variant\n"
"\n"
"Moreover, these rules can be set with date windows.\n"
"\n"
".. IMPORTANT::\n"
"   This is an alpha version, the data model and design can change at any time without warning.\n"
"   Only for development or testing purpose, do not use in production.\n"
