"\n"
"**Table of contents**\n"
"\n"
".. contents::\n"
"   :local:\n"
"\n"
"Usage\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"This module cannot be used alone.\n"
"\n"
"It defines method that helps to define if product can be used in a particular\n"
"country or not for a given date (today by default).\n"
"\n"
"Changelog\n"
"=========\n"
"\n"
"10.0.1.0.0 (2018-11-29)\n"
"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"* First version\n"
"\n"
