"~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\n"
"\n"
"* Allows to define different strategies by company:\n"
"* * Authorize (default): Authorize all products except those with a\n"
"    rule\n"
"* * Restrict: Restrict all products except those with a rule\n"
"\n"
"10.0.1.1.1 (2019-01-30)\n"
