"\n"
"Link refund invoice with original\n"
"=================================\n"
"\n"
"This module links customer and supplier refunds with the invoice that originate\n"
"them (and invoice lines).\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"-------------\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
