"-------------\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"To manage available ranges, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"* Go to *Sales > Configuration > Contacts > Ranges by quantity of employees*.\n"
"\n"
