"-----\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"* Go to any partner's form.\n"
"* Enable *Is company?*.\n"
"* You will see a new group of fields called *Employee quantity*.\n"
