"Web Widget - Image Download\n"
"===========================\n"
"\n"
"This module was written to extend the functionality of the image widget and allows to download it.\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"Configuration\n"
"-------------\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
