"=================================\n"
"\n"
"This module extends the functionality of the website portal to allow your\n"
"users to manage their contacts.\n"
"\n"
"Installation\n"
"------------\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
