"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"\n"
"=====\n"
"\n"
"To use this module, you need to:\n"
"\n"
"#. Log in as a portal user.\n"
"#. Go to `your portal home </my/home>`_.\n"
"#. Go to `your contacts manager </my/contacts>`_.\n"
"#. Read, create, edit or delete (disable) any contacts you want!\n"
